@Garimpo.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### Login (usuario seed: fiap@teste.com / 123456)
# @name login
POST {{Garimpo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "fiap@teste.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Registrar novo usuario
POST {{Garimpo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "novo@exemplo.com",
  "password": "senha123",
  "fullName": "Novo Analista"
}

### Ingerir catalogo TLE (requer Bearer)
POST {{Garimpo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ingestion?group=cosmos-2251-debris
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Executar clusterizacao DBSCAN (requer Bearer)
POST {{Garimpo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clusters/run
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "epsilon": 0.3,
  "minPoints": 5
}

### Listar aglomerados paginados (requer Bearer)
GET {{Garimpo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/clusters?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar detritos paginados (requer Bearer)
GET {{Garimpo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/debris?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar alertas (requer Bearer)
GET {{Garimpo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
